#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:342
msgid "Global (Costing Aggregator Only) (v5.5.1+)"
msgstr "Global (Costing Aggregator Only) (v5.5.1+)"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:344
msgid ""
"Costing can be created for specific clouds individually, following the "
"steps previously mentioned.  If the same account is added multiple times,"
" using different regions, the same CUR file is available to be selected "
"(if the configured user has access).  However, this can become a tedious "
"process in needing to configure the CUR on each cloud added to "
"|morpheus|.  However, |morpheus| has a region of `Global (Costing "
"Aggregator Only)`, which can be chosen at the time of adding a cloud.  "
"This region is not designed for deploying workloads, it is here primarily"
" for syncing costs.  This means that the AWS account added as a cloud in "
"|morpheus| as a Global region can sync the cost for all the other regions"
" of the same account added as clouds into |morpheus|."
msgstr ""
"Costing se puede crear para específico clouds individually, following el "
"pasos previamente mentioned.  If el mismo cuenta es agregado múltiples "
"times, using diferente regions, el mismo CUR archivo es disponible to be "
"seleccionado (if el configurado user tiene acceso).  Sin embargo, este "
"puede become un tedious proceso in needing to configure el CUR on cada "
"cloud agregado to |morpheus|.  Sin embargo, |morpheus| tiene un region of"
" `Global (Costing Aggregator Only)`, cual puede be chosen at el time of "
"adding una nube.  This region no es designed para deploying workloads, it"
" es aquí primarily para syncing costs.  This means que el AWS cuenta "
"agregado as una nube in |morpheus| as un Global region puede sync el cost"
" para todos el otro regions of el mismo cuenta agregado as clouds en "
"|morpheus|."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:348
msgid ""
"When using AWS Organizations, if the AWS account added as a global region"
" is the management account (formerly known as master account) and "
"consolidated billing is enabled, costs for **all** accounts can be sync'd"
" using the Global region.  This means when any AWS and/or regions in the "
"organization are added as clouds in |morpheus|, the appropriate costs are"
" applied to them automatically.  It does require that **Costing** is "
"enabled on the cloud to see the costs but a Costing Report does not need "
"to be chosen. This enables the use of one cloud added as Global to sync "
"all costs and apply to all AWS clouds added in |morpheus|."
msgstr ""
"When using AWS Organizations, if el AWS cuenta agregado as un global "
"region es el management cuenta (formerly known as master cuenta) y "
"consolidated billing es habilitado, costs para **todos** accounts puede "
"be sync'd using el Global region.  This means cuando cualquier AWS y/o "
"regions in el organization son agregado as clouds in |morpheus|, el "
"apropiado costs son applied to them automáticamente.  It does require que"
" **Costing** es habilitado on la nube to see el costs pero un Costing "
"Report no need to be chosen. This enables el use of one cloud agregado as"
" Global to sync todos costs y apply to todos AWS clouds agregado in "
"|morpheus|."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:352
msgid ""
"Additionally, some costs in AWS are not region specific, for example the "
"`Global` and `No Region` regions.  These costs do not apply to the "
"regions of the clouds added in |morpheus|.  With the Global region added "
"as a cloud in |morpheus|, you would be able to see these costs that are "
"applicable to your accounts."
msgstr ""
"Adicionalmente, algunos costs in AWS no son region específico, por "
"ejemplo el `Global` y `No Region` regions.  These costs no apply to el "
"regions of la nubes agregado in |morpheus|.  With el Global region "
"agregado as una nube in |morpheus|, you sería be able to see estos costs "
"que son applicable to your accounts."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:356
msgid "Costing and AWS GovCloud"
msgstr "Costing y AWS GovCloud"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:358
msgid ""
"AWS GovCloud delivers Amazon public cloud infrastructure and features in "
"a way that complies with U.S. government standards for security. GovCloud"
" accounts are applied for and must be associated with a pre-existing "
"standard AWS account and the usage and billing data for the GovCloud "
"account is rolled up into that of the standard AWS account. For that "
"reason, Amazon recommends creating a new standard account solely to house"
" the GovCloud account if usage and billing must be tracked separately."
msgstr ""
"AWS GovCloud delivers Amazon público cloud infrastructure y "
"características in un way que complies con U.S. government standards para"
" security. GovCloud accounts son applied para y debe be asociado con un "
"pre-existente standard AWS cuenta y el usage y billing datos para el "
"GovCloud cuenta es rolled up en que of el standard AWS cuenta. For que "
"reason, Amazon recommends creating un nuevo standard cuenta solely to "
"house el GovCloud cuenta if usage y billing debe be tracked separately."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:360
msgid ""
"Since GovCloud accounts do not have access to billing data directly, "
"|morpheus| must be able to access it through the associated standard "
"account. You could do this by creating the |morpheus| cloud integration "
"through the standard account itself or by integrating the GovCloud "
"account and supplying an Access Key and Secret Key for the standard "
"account when configuring costing. When needed, add the additional "
"credentials for the standard commercial account as described below:"
msgstr ""
"Since GovCloud accounts no tienen acceso to billing datos directly, "
"|morpheus| debe be able to acceso it a través de el associated standard "
"cuenta. You podría do este by creating el |morpheus| cloud integration a "
"través de el standard cuenta itself o by integrating el GovCloud cuenta y"
" supplying un Access Key y Secret Key para el standard cuenta cuando "
"configuring costing. When needed, add el adicional credentials para el "
"standard commercial cuenta as described a continuación:"

